  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Illusion sphere (any (glamer) talent), Protection sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Any attack that deals enough damage to break through your barrier treats all creatures that are contained within the barrier as if they were under the effects of a single (glamer) talent you possess before dealing damage. This glamer effect only applies to the attack that penetrates the barrier.</p>\n<p>When creating a non-trick glamer you may also grant the effects of a single aegis you possess to the target. The aegis effect added this way uses the duration of the glamer instead of its normal duration. This is not an actual aegis and does not provide any other benefits, such as those granted by the Status talent of the Protection sphere.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/illusion#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
